      <chord name="C"/>Who saved us from <chord name="F"/>e<chord name="C"/>ter<chord name="G7"/>nal <chord name="C"/>loss?<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>Who but God’s Son <chord name="F"/>up<chord name="C"/>on <chord name="G7"/>the <chord name="C"/>cross?<br/>
      <chord name="C"/>What did <chord name="G7"/>He <chord name="F"/>do? He died <chord name="C"/>for <chord name="Dm"/>you!<br/>
